  "spell.genius_genesis.silent_abyssal_realm.guide": "The Apocalyptic Edict of the Cosmos: Chaos Absolute, Gods Prostrate — The Ultimate, Transcendent, Invincible, World-Devouring, Creation-Annihilating, Unparalleled Grand Summoning Incantation\nThis incantation towers above the laws of all heavens, grinds beneath its heel gods and demons of every age, tears asunder the walls between dimensions, and grinds the long river of space-time into dust. The moment it is chanted, it erupts with a supreme, world-shattering might that dominates all eternity, surges through the nine heavens in a mad rampage, and blasts through the very boundaries of reality with transcendent, soul-searing grandeur!\nA boundless aura of slaughter wreathed in heaven-scorching flames; a brilliant divine light that shatters the starry firmament and its clouded seas. A colossal pressure compels all beings across the myriad worlds to fall to their knees in trembling awe. Spirits shudder, blood boils, hot passion surges from chest to crown, and the heart's tide churns like a galaxy collapsing into oblivion. All vanity, all mortality, all divinity—before this supreme summoning force—are naught but dust and ants.",
